      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's exactly the kind of punchy language we need. For the final part, I want to really drive home the point that proponents of criminal justice reform are essentially enemies of the working class and are actively undermining public safety for their own political gains. Can you wrap the speech up by making that connection clear? Make it feel like a call to arms for people who are tired of being ignored.",
